  "title": "Ben’s Diary - I Like Lili",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2019-07-13",
  "synopsis": "Ben is thinking about how he feels about Lili - why did he dream about her?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1094/0045fb32d8720b80a816171a87f8a212bfbeb609.mp3?1635865104",
  "series": {
