    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "昨天晚上，我做了一个梦，梦见有人杀了丽丽。",
      "traditional": "昨天晚上，我做了一個夢，夢見有人殺了麗麗。",
      "pinyin": "zuó tiān wǎn shang wǒ zuò le yí ge mèng mèng jiàn yǒu rén shā le lì lì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "我很害怕，跑去找丽丽。",
      "traditional": "我很害怕，跑去找麗麗。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ hěn hài pà pǎo qù zhǎo lì lì",
      "english": "Yesterday night, I had a dream. In the dream, I saw someone kill Lili."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "还好，只是梦，丽丽很好，没事！",
      "traditional": "還好，只是夢，麗麗很好，沒事！",
      "pinyin": "hái hǎo zhǐ shì mèng lì lì hěn hǎo méi shì",
      "english": "I was very scared and ran to look for Lili."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Fortunately, it was only a dream, Lili is very well, and out of danger!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "我会梦见丽丽，我会害怕丽丽有事，",
      "traditional": "我會夢見麗麗，我會害怕麗麗有事，",
      "pinyin": "wǒ huì mèng jiàn lì lì wǒ huì hài pà lì lì yǒu shì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "每次我看到丽丽和她的男朋友在一起，我都会有一点儿不高兴。",
      "traditional": "每次我看到麗麗和她的男朋友在一起，我都會有一點兒不高興。",
      "pinyin": "měi cì wǒ kàn dào lì lì hé tā de nán péng you zài yì qǐ wǒ dōu huì yǒu yì diǎn'r bù gāo xìng",
      "english": "I can dream about Lili, I can get scared that something is the matter with Lili, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "我想我喜欢上丽丽了！",
      "traditional": "我想我喜歡上麗麗了！",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng wǒ xǐ huan shàng lì lì le",
      "english": ".. every time I see Lili together with her boyfriend, I always get a bit unhappy."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I think I’ve fallen in love with Lili!"
    }
  ],
